                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore too lotot aainei nemayeng'iyeng'a, nanoto batisho too lkejek, batisho too laisimak, batisho to lorere lang, batisho too ltung'ana loo Loreren, batisho ti atua enkanasa, batisho ti ong'ata, batisho ti atua enaiposha, batisho ti atua lelo ooitaakuno lalashera.",
          "type": "text",
